      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ここは滝の回廊といって\r\n七つの滝が集まる名所です。\r\nただ、今はこの先に用はありませんね。",
        "official_en": "This is Waterfall Way, a site famous for its seven waterfalls. We have no business here at present.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
