      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この先の旧市街は、水没の影響で\r\n立ち入り禁止とさせていただいております。",
        "official_en": "Old Town is ahead, but it is off-limits at present due to flooding.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
