      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "みなさんは、北の援護へ向かってください。\r\nレイン……エルを頼みます。",
        "official_en": "Bolster the forces in the north, everyone. Rain...I’ll entrust El to you.",
        "real_en": "Everyone, head north and provide support. Rain... Please look after El."
      },
