      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "オルデリオンはそっちじゃないぞ。\r\nまずはオルデリオンで情報を\r\n集めてみよう。",
        "official_en": "We need to gather information in Olderion first, and this isn’t the way.",
        "real_en": "That's not the way to Olderion. Let's gather information there first."
